Typical Instruments: Fender Stratocaster (optical tremolo, chorus, bridge-pickup chime), Roland TR-808 (heavily saturated, pitch-bent slide bass), steel pans run through bitcrushers, live congas, frozen woodblocks, and bio-telemetry heart monitors.

